ou for your honesty, and for finally showing clearly and unequivocally your prejudice. At least once in your life you can show your true colors and the full dimension of your racism towards me. That's how I like it, say it how it is, no cynism, no insinuations, no sugarcoating your true intentions; show everybody your true despicable self. So, you know absolutely nothing about me, but based on 3 posts you already know that I listen to... Err let me see... Alex Jones, Andrew Tate... Oh yes, I also think that minorities own me everything, I frequent 4chan (I'll be honest here, I don't even know what the hell is 4chan, I abomine social medias) and I used to draw incorrect swastikas as a kid.<br /> <br /> \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bThank you so much for exposing yourself, &quot;pal&quot;. Thank you for showing us all what a despicable and loathsome creature you truly are. Those are some very nice stereotypes you got there. Thank you for having those just because of the colour of my skin. Thank you for doing the work of your little hate cult, you truly learned to utterly hate anyone that isn't like you. Those were some nice shallow stereotypes you got there, &quot;pal&quot;.<br /> <br /> But I do agree with you in one thing: whenever you're looking for the bigot, you should take a deep look at the mirror. You are 100% right in that one. Too bad you lack necessary self reflection to realize what a pitiful and hateful creature you are. I feel sorry for you, hate is a poison that will only harm yourself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28035-magus-maximus","name":"Magus Maximus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-16T03:51:51-08:00","id":1526915,"title":"","c