hey, like a typical spoiled Millennial, you can't just disagree about an issue, you have to throw a tamper tantrum about it, because you're a spoiled little brat. And you still think I have an unfair criticism towards Millennials... Yeah, right.<br /> <br /> Now, let us continue. No, I didn't vote for Trump, nor for Hillary nor for Biden nor for any other.<br /> <br /> And the reason being is that I'm not an American, I'm a Brazilian.<br /> <br /> And about &quot;minorities owing me everything&quot;, I have pale skin and blue eyes, however my father is brown, and although my daughter have a skin as pale as snow, like my mother, my son came with a light brown skin. Both my children, with the same mother.<br /> <br /> You know nothing about me pal. You don't know that while your spoiled little brat ass lives in a developed nation, and while you probably went to a university, I live right next to a favela. Do you know what a favela is, &quot;pal&quot;? My neighbors are black, my boss is brown, my co-workers are brown, here in Brazil we all live mixed together.<br /> <br /> Shut the fuck up you little spoiled racist piece of shit. You know nothing about the real world, and I won't let you use my skin color as an object of hate for your despicable little hate club","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28035-magus-maximus","name":"Magus Maximus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-16T04:55:20-08:00","id":1526918,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#c0392b\">Magus Maximus, please take a week off for multiple personal attacks and please read the </span><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\"><span style=\"color:#c0392b\">rules of the forum </span></a><span style=\"color:#c0392b\">before posting again. Additionally, please consider that this is an English speaking internet forum owned by an American company and when you invoke &quot;the blacks&quot; in this context you're going to look like a white nationalist and it's your failure to communicate otherwise. <br /> <br /> If you have a problem with this ruling please go to the &quot;Contact Us&quot; button at the bottom of your screen. </span></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-16T07:15:17-08:00","id":1526923,"title":"","content":"So anyway, cynicism in the World of Darkness. Yeah, as pointed out up thread, the '90's was also when the gritty Dark Age of Comic Books was a thing. Everything in the '90s seemed to have this need to be edgy and XXXTREEEEEME.<br /> <br /> Probably a cultural impact of the Reaganite '80s, casting a shadow over everything as capitalism asserted its dominance and as said elsewhere, the &quot;ladder got pulled up after the successful&quot; and everyone started realizing how truly fucked they were.<br /> <br /> And honestly, I don't think that has ever gone away. A lot of people of my generation and Gen Z are noticing diminishing returns. I think maybe that's why the World of Darkness enjoyed a major comeback with 20th Anniversary Edition and 5th Edition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28074-doktor-von-zwitter","name":"Doktor von Zwitter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28074_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-16T08:49:55-08:00","id":1526926,"title":"","content":"I would agree that probably played a pretty big part. I think there's been a bit of ebb and flow in people's optimism about the status quo, but it's been trending pretty steadily downwards for over a decade now, I'd say.<br /> <br /> Something that thinking about all of this made me reflect on is the contrast with nWoD/CoD. There is cynicism and pessimism in there as well, but it's presented more as the general negativity needed to maintain a horror environment, rather than a punk commentary on reality in the form of a horror environment in an RPG. Perhaps WoD feels more cynical because it's more actively trying to motivate you with that cynicism, rather than just setting the mood for a game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25886-kharnov","name":"Kharnov","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"683"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-16T11:02:43-08:00","id":1526929,"title":"","content":"Yes, but maybe because the world is such a messed up place today, escapist RPGs such as D&amp;D are generally more popular than more cynical ones like WoD which purport to expose the dark side of today\u2019s world. Or at least that\u2019s been my experience.<br /> <br /> Although Trinity Continuum, which has a much brighter outlook than WoD, is not nearly as popular, so maybe that doesn\u2019t universally hold true.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":26996,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","user":"Amethyst","date":". 12-16-2023, 02:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-16T11:18:37-08:00","id":1526930,"title":"","content":"D&amp;D runs the gamut of fantasy genres, depending on how the DM wants to build their world. It does allow for a near total escape from the Hellworld we exist in though. That much is true.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28074-doktor-von-zwitter","name":"Doktor von Zwitter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28074_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-16T22:59:53-08:00","id":1526967,"title":"","content":"I mean the Occam's Razor answer?<br /> <br /> 1. It' a horror game line<br /> <br /> 2. It's a game line inspired by Punk so its dystopian.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-17T10:52:18-08:00","id":1526986,"title":"","content":"Are we talking in-universe or why its written the way it is? <br /> <br /> I'd say a chunk of it out of universe is sort of a thing that happens when you explain things divorced from the tone the books give. Like the Technocracy is really oppressive and dark organization bent on manipulating the very idea of reality to keep humanity blissfully compliant and following its designs. But you tell the stories and you have to explain how the Men in Black jumped the Cult of Ecstasy stoner and the warrior monk from Akashics in a back alley because the New World Order organized a traffic accident to stop them from meeting up with the rest of their group.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-18T08:38:27-08:00","id":1527056,"title":"","content":"Overall, I'd say that WoD isn't really cynical at all. Or, perhaps it is better to say it is naively or idealistically cynical. More often than not there are external reasons why everything is crap. There are supernatural conspiracies that twist systems to their own ends and malevolent metaphysical forces that degrade everything they touch; things that can be identified, named, and fought. The world is as it is because some things want it that way and others failed to stop it, not because the current state of affairs was inevitable or due to inescapable failings on the part of everyone involved. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-20T16:17:40-08:00","id":1527131,"title":"","content":"And lots of lawyers here; I've done family-law. When I talk about divorces, I just talk, &quot;Shop&quot;, which shocks most people I talk to, just how casually I talk about it; maybe I'm cynical on that subject. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ramnesis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1525827-why-is-wod-so-cynical?p=1527056#post1527056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Overall, I'd say that WoD isn't really cynical at all. Or, perhaps it is better to say it is naively or idealistically cynical. More often than not there are external reasons why everything is crap. There are supernatural conspiracies that twist systems to their own ends and malevolent metaphysical forces that degrade everything they touch; things that can be identified, named, and fought. The world is as it is because some things want it that way and others failed to stop it, not because the current state of affairs was inevitable or due to inescapable failings on the part of everyone involved.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>WoD really isn't, that, cynical. Requiem is far more cynical than V:tM.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}